16. Terrain Classification

The Metamap first asks:

What kind of terrain is this?

Possible semantic terrain classes:

* causal
* ambiguous
* adversarial
* temporal
* relational
* symbolic
* computational
* narrative
* optimization
* high-dimensional
* sparse evidence
* conflicting evidence
* moving-target
* recursive
* high-loss translation
