17. Strategic Recommendation

Given new query Q, Metamap performs:

Q
\rightarrow
\phi(Q)
\rightarrow
\operatorname{RetrieveSimilarTerrain}
\rightarrow
\operatorname{RankStrategies}
\rightarrow
\Pi^\*

Pseudo-process:

INPUT
 ↓
classify semantic terrain
 ↓
retrieve related route fossils
 ↓
retrieve successful Seal formations
 ↓
retrieve failure fossils
 ↓
estimate portal costs and loss
 ↓
select candidate strategies
 ↓
reserve exploration budget
 ↓
deploy formation
 ↓
observe outcome
 ↓
store afterglow
 ↓
update Metamap

