21. Core Invariant

The Metamap must preserve one foundational distinction:

\boxed{
\text{A strategy that produced a coherent answer}
\neq
\text{a strategy that produced a correct answer}
}

Therefore validated utility must remain distinct from internal coherence.

Metaphorical and latent-space discoveries may generate candidates.

Reality Stitch determines which candidates deserve confidence.

⸻

22. Canonical Doctrine

Do not only remember what was learned. Remember how it became learnable.

A successful reasoning journey produces two outputs:

\text{knowledge}

and:

\text{knowledge about producing knowledge}

The second output belongs to the Metamap.

Repeated experience therefore produces:

\text{better answers}
\rightarrow
\text{better routes}
\rightarrow
\text{better formations}
\rightarrow
\text{better operators}
\rightarrow
\text{better ways to learn}

This is the Metamap’s compounding loop.

